{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2019-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1554076800, "end_date": 1554681599, "month_true_total": 304, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:09:49 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "50021705", "author": {"steamid": "76561198272024245", "personaname": "Captain Hairy Shoulders", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198272024245/", "num_games_owned": 174, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 236796, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 83308, "last_played": 1790251405, "avatar": "7f849035d5e8ef490ff9979cf868e3aed4e65381"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its okay I guess.\n\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1554679265, "timestamp_updated": 1667435023, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50019560", "author": {"steamid": "76561198874061838", "personaname": "Zentric", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198874061838/", "num_games_owned": 120, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 95451, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1811, "last_played": 1789922165, "avatar": "ca1403f826aee1825781442a66cdaf276a824cce"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game has a bit of everything for everyone:\n-Role-play aspects\n-Military simulation\n-You can create your own maps and play with friends\n-You can play with a wide community\n-You can get a zombie mod if that's what you like\n-Finally there is campaign for people who don't like online\nAs well as this the game has brilliant attention to detail:\n-The sound of explosions comes before the visual\n-The maps have amazing detail such as the forests that stretch across the map\n-Or cities that cover the map\n-And maybe a little bit of both like the map Atlis\nAnd finally the combat:\nThe military styled vehicles and weaponry provide an amazing game play experience like real life.You can battle under water with the scuba suits and use the APS Under water assault rifle or the SPP-1 Pistol.You can also battle it out on land with tanks,military MRAPS,APC's or just regular cars.But there is plenty of combat in the sky with planes like the AC-130 or the A-10 Warthog but there's also helicopters like the Orca or the Cobra attack helicopter.\n\nSo no matter what your style is there is something in Arma for everyone.", "timestamp_created": 1554669768, "timestamp_updated": 1554669768, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50019166", "author": {"steamid": "76561198257623371", "personaname": "pben9", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198257623371/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 166185, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 54569, "last_played": 1790022679, "avatar": "7bae4c45e7c94342fccfc747eee0370081cba5c9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Sent a leopard into space, enjoyed the ride.", "timestamp_created": 1554668027, "timestamp_updated": 1554668027, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50017547", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014388120", "personana